				},
				{
					"id": 120001003,
					"content": "你居然有「神之眼」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001004
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120001004,
					"content": "嗯，只不过以「神之眼」退敌有恃强凌弱之嫌，所以我不太喜欢用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "行秋"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001008,
					"content": "他们现在走了，但肯定会再来找麻烦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001009,
					"content": "我知道，我不会害了我的恩人，商有商道，这件事我会负责到底。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "行秋"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001010,
					"content": "「愚人众」平常不会站在某个商人一边，但看那家丁的嚣张态度，应该所言非虚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "行秋"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001011,
					"content": "这其中多半是有更深的勾结。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "行秋"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001012,
					"content": "刚才他们提到的「茂才公」，这名号我也听过，他的宅子在璃月港很显眼，拜托你们去打探些线索吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "行秋"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001013,
					"content": "道理是有道理的…那你要干什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001014
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001014,
					"content": "我？我还有其他想要了解的事，我想想…等下我们就在璃月港的玉京台见吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "行秋"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001015,
					"content": "真的吗？不会只是想使唤我们去跑腿吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001016,
					"content": "哦哦，竟然发生了这样的事，这一段真是妙，妙不可言！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "行秋"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001017,
					"content": "唔唔唔！气死我了！我可以打他吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001018,
						120001019
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001018,
					"content": "还是要先帮常九爷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120001020,
					"content": "好吧，但每个惹我生气的人我都要给他取个难听的绰号！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001021
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001021,
					"content": "就叫他「书呆子」好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120001019,
					"content": "君子报仇，十年不晚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120001005,
					"content": "其实古华派是藏龙卧虎之地？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120001006,
					"content": "不不不，你误会了，刚才那人的话虽不堪入耳，但对古华派的评价…其实也不算错…唉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120001007
